SO I WILL BE SURPRISED IF WE

00:01:12.596 --> 00:01:14.938
DON’T CROSS 200,000 CASES IN THE

00:01:14.939 --> 00:01:16.399
NEXT COUPLE OF WEEKS AND THAT’S

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:16.917
HEARTBREAKING CONSIDERING WE

00:01:16.928 --> 00:01:19.017
NEVER THOUGHT WE WOULD BE BACK

00:01:19.051 --> 00:01:20.680
IN THAT SPACE AGAIN.

00:01:20.691 --> 00:01:22.165
IF THAT WAS JANUARY, FEBRUARY.

00:01:22.176 --> 00:01:23.692
THAT SHOULDN’T BE AUGUST, BUT

00:01:23.703 --> 00:01:26.706
HERE WE ARE WITH DELTA VARIANT

00:01:26.717 --> 00:01:28.979
WHICH IS SO CONTAGIOUS AND THIS

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:29.962
HEARTBREAKING SITUATION WHERE

00:01:29.973 --> 00:01:31.025
90 MILLION PEOPLE ARE STILL

00:01:31.036 --> 00:01:32.211
UNVACCINATED WHAT ARE SITTING

00:01:32.245 --> 00:01:33.541
DUCKS FOR THIS VIRUS AND THAT’S

00:01:33.552 --> 00:01:34.761
THE MESS WE ARE IN.

00:01:34.795 --> 00:01:36.639
WE ARE IN A WORLD OF HURT AND

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:37.603
IT’S A CRITICAL JUNCTURE TO TRY

00:01:37.604 --> 00:01:40.304
TO DO EVERYTHING WE CAN TO TURN

00:01:40.315 --> 00:01:41.632
THAT AROUND.

00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:44.891
&gt;&gt; Chris: WE ARE ALSO SEEING A

00:01:44.892 --> 00:01:47.055
SHARP RISE IN THE NUMBER OF

00:01:47.066 --> 00:01:49.133
