00:01:49.167 --> 00:01:50.440
UNVACCINATED KIDS AND VACCINATED

00:01:50.451 --> 00:01:53.014
KIDS WHO ARE GETTING COVID FROM

00:01:53.025 --> 00:01:54.582
THIS NEW DELTA VARIANT.

00:01:54.616 --> 00:01:57.837
HOW BAD COULD THAT SPIKE IN

00:01:57.848 --> 00:01:58.759
PEDIATRIC CASES?

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:00.686
&gt;&gt; Dr. Collins: THAT’S VERY

00:02:00.697 --> 00:02:01.072
WORRISOME.

00:02:01.106 --> 00:02:02.368
I THINK TRADITIONALLY PEOPLE

00:02:02.369 --> 00:02:03.581
KIND OF CONSIDERED, WELL, YOU

00:02:03.592 --> 00:02:04.843
KNOW, KIDS AREN’T GOING TO GET

00:02:04.876 --> 00:02:05.867
THAT SICK WITH THIS.

00:02:05.878 --> 00:02:08.313
IT MORE THAN 400 CHILDREN HAVE

00:02:08.347 --> 00:02:10.643
DIED OF COVID-19 AND RIGHT NOW

00:02:10.654 --> 00:02:13.641
WE HAVE ALMOST 2,000 KIDS IN THE

00:02:13.652 --> 00:02:15.190
HOSPITAL, MANY OF THEM IN ICU,

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:16.313
SOME OF THEM UNDER THE AGE OF

00:02:16.324 --> 00:02:17.702
FOUR, SO ANYBODY WHO TRIES TO

00:02:17.713 --> 00:02:19.676
TELL YOU DON’T WORRY ABOUT THE

00:02:19.687 --> 00:02:21.158
KIDS, THE VIRUS WON’T REALLY

00:02:21.169 --> 00:02:22.389
BOTHER THEM, THAT’S NOT THE

00:02:22.423 --> 00:02:23.811
EVIDENCE AND ESPECIALLY WITH

00:02:23.812 --> 00:02:25.229
DELTA BEING SO CONTAGIOUS, KIDS

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:27.192
ARE VERY SERIOUSLY AT RISK AND

00:02:27.203 --> 00:02:29.210
IT’S UP TO ALL OF US TO DO

00:02:29.221 --> 00:02:30.023
EVERYTHING WE CAN TO PROTECT

00:02:30.057 --> 00:02:31.000
THEM, AS WELL AS WE ARE TRYING

00:02:31.011 --> 00:02:33.393
TO PROTECTIVE HER BODY ELSE AT

00:02:33.394 --> 00:02:35.452
THE SAME TIME.

00:02:35.453 --> 00:02:36.824
&gt;&gt; Chris: TALK ABOUT

00:02:36.835 --> 00:02:38.554
