00:02:38.565 --> 00:02:42.730
ACROSS THE COUNTRY HAVE BANS IN

00:02:42.764 --> 00:02:45.000
PLACE, BANS AGAINST MANDATES FOR

00:02:45.011 --> 00:02:46.974
