00:03:32.781 --> 00:03:33.781
IT’S REALLY UNFORTUNATE THAT

00:03:33.783 --> 00:03:35.053
POLITICS AND POLARIZATION HAVE

00:03:35.064 --> 00:03:36.889
GOT IN THE WAY OF A SIMPLE

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.128
