00:03:38.139 --> 00:03:38.930
THAT I’M HOLDING HAS SOMEHOW

00:03:38.941 --> 00:03:40.810
BECOME A SYMBOL THAT IT NEVER

00:03:40.821 --> 00:03:41.495
SHOULD HAVE BEEN.

00:03:41.529 --> 00:03:43.731
THIS IS BASICALLY JUST A

00:03:43.742 --> 00:03:45.219
