00:03:45.253 --> 00:03:47.415
SOMEHOW IT’S NOW BEING SEEN AS

00:03:47.426 --> 00:03:48.612
AN INVASION OF YOUR PERSONAL

00:03:48.646 --> 00:03:48.958
LIBERTY.

