WE NEVER SHOULD HAVE GONE THERE.

00:03:50.187 --> 00:03:52.658
IT’S HEARTBREAKING FOR ME AS A

00:03:52.669 --> 00:03:54.223
PERSON WHO’S NOT A POLITICIAN,

00:03:54.234 --> 00:03:55.409
I’M A SCIENTIST.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.233
I’M A PUBLIC HEALTH PERSON, I’M

00:03:57.244 --> 00:03:58.755
A DOCTOR, TO SEE HOW MASKS HAVE

00:03:58.766 --> 00:04:00.452
GOTTEN INTO THIS VERY STRANGE

00:04:00.463 --> 00:04:02.337
