00:05:23.244 --> 00:05:24.265
INCREDIBLE DEPTH OF ANGER AND

00:05:24.276 --> 00:05:26.576
GRIEVANCE THAT SEEMS TO BE HELD

00:05:26.587 --> 00:05:27.658
