OUR FUTURE AS A NATION HAS GOT

00:05:29.912 --> 00:05:31.291
TO REVOLVE AROUND COMING AWAY

00:05:31.302 --> 00:05:33.050
FROM THAT AND UP APPROACH TO

00:05:33.084 --> 00:05:34.576
EVERYTHING OR I DON’T SEE HOW WE

00:05:34.587 --> 00:05:37.004
ARE GOING TO SOLVE ALL OF OUR

00:05:37.015 --> 00:05:38.416
SOCIETY’S PROBLEMS, WHICH ARE

00:05:38.427 --> 00:05:39.397
LOOMING IN FRONT OF US.

