00:06:40.559 --> 00:06:42.245
THIS IS A TRICKY SITUATION.

00:06:42.256 --> 00:06:45.107
FIRST LET’S POINT OUT THAT JUST

00:06:45.118 --> 00:06:46.980
ON FRIDAY CDC’S ADVISORY GROUP

00:06:47.014 --> 00:06:48.711
