00:06:48.722 --> 00:06:50.106
IT, APPROVED A THIRD SHOT FOR

00:06:50.117 --> 00:06:51.202
PEOPLE WHO HAVE IMMUNOCOPPER

00:06:51.204 --> 00:06:52.184
MICE, BUT THAT’S A SEPARATE

00:06:52.185 --> 00:06:52.626
QUESTION.

00:06:52.627 --> 00:06:54.164
WHAT ABOUT THE REST OF US?

00:06:54.175 --> 00:06:56.852
AGAIN, WE’RE LOOKING AT THIS

00:06:56.885 --> 00:06:57.953
DATA ALMOST DAILY.

00:06:57.964 --> 00:07:00.227
IF THERE IS A CONCERN THAT THE

00:07:00.261 --> 00:07:03.258
VACCINE MAY START TO WANE IN ITS

00:07:03.269 --> 00:07:04.022
EFFECTIVENESS OVER MONTHS AND

