WE HAVE NOT MADE THAT DECISION

00:07:18.826 --> 00:07:20.386
YET BECAUSE RIGHT NOW IF THE

00:07:20.397 --> 00:07:22.964
DATA WE HAVE FROM THE U.S. SAYS

00:07:22.965 --> 00:07:24.944
PEOPLE WHO ARE VACCINATED ARE

00:07:24.955 --> 00:07:26.095
FULLY PROTECTED, EVEN AGAINST

