00:07:27.663 --> 00:07:28.148
SEVERE DISEASE.

00:07:28.149 --> 00:07:29.888
IF YOU’RE NOT GOING TO END UP IN

00:07:29.899 --> 00:07:31.021
A HOSPITAL IF YOU HAVE THAT

00:07:31.055 --> 00:07:32.478
VACCINATION AND OF COURSE THE

00:07:32.479 --> 00:07:33.855
