YOU SAY WELL, IF THEY ARE DOING

00:08:19.279 --> 00:08:20.351
IT, I’LL DO IT?

00:08:20.362 --> 00:08:22.526
&gt;&gt; Dr. Collins: IN FACT THAT

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:23.927
IS THE QUESTION WE ARE ASKING

00:08:23.928 --> 00:08:24.332
CLOSELY.

00:08:24.333 --> 00:08:25.692
REMEMBER ISRAEL HAD DELTA HIT

00:08:25.693 --> 00:08:28.357
THEM SOONER THAN IT DID US, SO

00:08:28.368 --> 00:08:30.190
IN A CERTAIN WAY, THE TIMETABLE

00:08:30.223 --> 00:08:31.091
WE’RE LOOKING AT HIS STEPPED

00:08:31.102 --> 00:08:33.531
BACK A BIT BECAUSE OF THE SPREAD

00:08:33.565 --> 00:08:34.477
OF THIS VIRUS.

00:08:34.478 --> 00:08:35.451
THAT’S PART OF IT.

00:08:35.462 --> 00:08:37.843
BUT ALSO WE ARE A DIFFERENT KIND

00:08:37.876 --> 00:08:38.836
OF COUNTRY WITH DIFFERENT

00:08:38.837 --> 00:08:39.252
SITUATIONS.

00:08:39.263 --> 00:08:41.052
WE ARE GETTING INCREASING A

00:08:41.086 --> 00:08:42.375
MONTH OF DATA FROM THE U.S.,

00:08:42.386 --> 00:08:43.243
ESPECIALLY THE NEXT COUPLE OF

00:08:43.276 --> 00:08:43.589
WEEKS.

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:45.267
WE ARE GOING TO SEE A LOT SINCE

00:08:45.278 --> 00:08:46.567
DELTA REALLY STARTED HITTING

00:08:46.578 --> 00:08:47.455
HARD IN JULY.

00:08:47.466 --> 00:08:49.184
AND THEN WE WILL MAKE A DECISION

00:08:49.195 --> 00:08:50.673
AND AGAIN, I DON’T THINK IT’S

00:08:50.707 --> 00:08:51.972
RIGHT FOR PEOPLE TO JUMP THE GUN

00:08:51.983 --> 00:08:52.699
UNTIL WE REALLY HAVE THE

00:08:52.733 --> 00:08:53.037
EVIDENCE.

00:08:53.048 --> 00:08:55.024
WE ARE BACK TO WHERE WE WERE A

00:08:55.035 --> 00:08:55.797
MINUTE AGO, CHRIS.

00:08:55.808 --> 00:08:57.838
WE ARE A NATION THAT IS SUPPOSED

00:08:57.849 --> 00:08:58.768
TO MAKE DECISIONS BASED ON

00:08:58.779 --> 00:09:00.795
EVIDENCE, LET’S TRY TO APPLY

00:09:00.806 --> 00:09:03.390
THAT HERE TOO.

00:09:03.424 --> 00:09:05.019
&gt;&gt; Chris: FINALLY,

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:07.590
GOVERNOR DeSANTIS BLAMES

00:09:07.601 --> 00:09:09.793
PRESIDENT TRUMP FOR SPREADING

00:09:09.804 --> 00:09:12.831
COVID BY LETTING SO MANY PEOPLE

00:09:12.865 --> 00:09:14.344
WITH COVID INTO THE COUNTRY

00:09:14.345 --> 00:09:14.891
ILLEGALLY.

00:09:14.902 --> 00:09:17.674
HERE WAS GOVERNOR DeSANTIS ON

00:09:17.685 --> 00:09:17.964
THAT.

00:09:17.998 --> 00:09:19.086
&gt;&gt; WHATEVER VARIANCE ARE AROUND

00:09:19.087 --> 00:09:20.507
THE WORLD, THEY ARE COMING

00:09:20.518 --> 00:09:22.808
ACROSS THAT SOUTHERN BORDER SO

00:09:22.819 --> 00:09:24.022
HE’S NOT SHUTTING DOWN THE

00:09:24.056 --> 00:09:25.963
VIRUS, HE’S HELPING TO

00:09:25.974 --> 00:09:27.595
FACILITATE IT IN OUR COUNTRY.

00:09:27.629 --> 00:09:29.080
&gt;&gt; Chris: YOUR TALK ABOUT

00:09:29.091 --> 00:09:30.473
DEALING WITH THE SCIENCE,

00:09:30.506 --> 00:09:31.859
DEALING WITH FACTS, I’M GOING TO

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.400
ASK YOU ABOUT THAT.

00:09:33.411 --> 00:09:34.590
AND PARTS OF TEXAS, THE

00:09:34.624 --> 00:09:36.719
POSITIVITY RATE FOR COVID AMONG

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:38.680
SOME OF THE ILLEGAL MIGRANTS

00:09:38.681 --> 00:09:40.008
COMING ACROSS THE BORDER IS OVER

00:09:40.042 --> 00:09:40.730
10%.

00:09:40.741 --> 00:09:43.741
HOW RESPONSIBLE ARE THEY FOR

00:09:43.752 --> 00:09:45.582
SPREADING FOR THIS WAVE OF COVID

00:09:45.593 --> 00:09:49.975
THAT IS SWEEPING THE COUNTRY

00:09:49.986 --> 00:09:51.127
RIGHT NOW?

00:09:51.138 --> 00:09:53.390
&gt;&gt; Dr. Collins: IT CERTAINLY A

00:09:53.401 --> 00:09:54.300
CAUSE OF CONCERN.

00:09:54.334 --> 00:09:55.534
THEY HAVE VERY SIGNIFICANT

00:09:55.535 --> 00:09:56.436
MASKING REQUIREMENTS THERE BUT

00:09:56.447 --> 00:09:57.348
IT IS CERTAINLY POSSIBLE.

00:09:57.381 --> 00:09:59.454
BUT YOU KNOW, LET NOBODY TRY TO

00:09:59.465 --> 00:10:01.216
SAY THAT’S WHY THE U.S. IS IN

00:10:01.249 --> 00:10:01.678
TROUBLE.

00:10:01.689 --> 00:10:03.903
THE RATE OF INFECTION IN MEXICO

00:10:03.937 --> 00:10:05.688
IS ACTUALLY LOWER THAN IT IS

00:10:05.699 --> 00:10:07.649
RIGHT NOW IN PLACES LIKE TEXAS

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:09.102
AND LOUISIANA AND FLORIDA.

00:10:09.113 --> 00:10:10.671
I THINK THAT’S A BIT OF A

00:10:10.672 --> 00:10:10.864
DISTRACTION.

00:10:10.875 --> 00:10:12.738
WE’VE GOT ENOUGH OF A PROBLEM

00:10:12.749 --> 00:10:14.399
WITH HER OWN CITIZENS WHO HAVE

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:15.601
REFUSED TO ROLL UP THEIR

00:10:15.635 --> 00:10:16.507
SLEEVES, SO MAYBE THAT WOULD BE

00:10:16.508 --> 00:10:19.127
A BETTER THING TO FOCUS ON IF WE

00:10:19.138 --> 00:10:20.099
ARE TRYING TO END THIS.

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:21.471
THAT SEEMED LIKE IT WAS NOT

00:10:21.482 --> 00:10:22.645
GOING TO GET US WHERE WE NEED TO

00:10:22.656 --> 00:10:22.882
BE.

00:10:22.916 --> 00:10:24.004
IT’S AN ISSUE, BUT IT IS

00:10:24.015 --> 00:10:26.848
CERTAINLY NOT THE CAUSE OF OUR

00:10:26.859 --> 00:10:27.669
CURRENT DILEMMA.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:28.683
&gt;&gt; Chris: DR. COLLINS,

00:10:28.717 --> 00:10:28.934
THANK YOU.

